/yD9vsaVUKmKvPytdkc1X5ufdla6.jpg"},{"id":1054839,"name":"Matthew Ziff","role":"Bronco","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sdUR6Tl4xFWAimzLqDPIkrILNRZ.jpg"},{"id":1222666,"name":"Oren Hawxhurst","role":"Fighter","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fzPRlw2IKsU00xIUYYFKRuyZ7X0.jpg"},{"id":83448,"name":"Fabrício Werdum","role":"Fighter","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8bN7yLcyZqSqZMchtZJ2ZbYy3Pu.jpg"},{"id":1578720,"name":"Divine Prince Ty Emmecca","role":"VIP International","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qULeWCcfXUT7PnZIDG7wnf8nRys.jpg"},{"id":2924687,"name":"Dante Ha","role":"Compound Fighter"},{"id":1680202,"name":"Mike Wilson","role":"Compound Fighter","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tCDwcuDsc13C2NDm9TIl1dOQoxZ.jpg"},{"id":2363638,"name":"Luke J. Watson","role":"Compound Fighter"},{"id":549450,"name":"Ronn Surels","role":"Compound Fighter","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AhooxXLydxFNYsUzEGjHpNdkzVl.jpg"},{"id":1463691,"name":"Eric Stratemeier","role":"Compound Fighter","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j9eOttg2cpRQwBnWLRqWdopNVz0.jpg"},{"id":139440,"name":"Tyron Woodley","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qZu289we6bGCFYgTqKLrbrdhfvz.jpg"},{"id":1748388,"name":"Gino Galento","role":"VIP Guest","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u2y7jYeSNrvU7JVdKeoFFnEVo1a.jpg"},{"id":222508,"name":"Michel Qissi","role":"Prisoner","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zl64reyhHgnrDFcDWx7lNKaVfmm.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Kickboxer - La vendetta del guerriero","overview":"Eric e Kurt Sloane sono i discendenti di una ben nota famiglia esperta di arti marziali. Da sempre nell'ombra del fratello maggiore Eric, Kurt non ha ma dimostrato di avere l'istinto necessario per trasformarsi in un campione. Nonostante le preoccupazioni di Kurt, Eric accetta un'offerta vantaggiosa e parte per la Thailandia allo scopo di sfidare il campione Tong Po. L'incontro ha però conseguenze fatali e in Kurt matura il desiderio di vendetta, cercando gli insegnamenti di Durand, il mentore del fratello."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Eric and Kurt Sloane are the descendants of a well-known Venice, California-based family of martial artists. Kurt has always been in older brother, Eric's shadow, as he lacks the instincts needed to become a champion. Against Kurt's concerns, Eric accepts a paid offer and travels to Thailand to challenge the Muay Thai champion Tong Po and fails with dire consequences. Kurt sets out for revenge. He trains with his brother's mentor, Master Durand, for a Muay Thai fight against the merciless champion, Tong Po. Durand first thinks Kurt is impossible to train, but through a series of spiritual exercises and tests, Durand discovers that Kurt has a deeper strength that will carry him through his final showdown with Tong Po.","tagline":"The legend returns."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ryB7c9cdwSdQlMIu9OsnDKmq2Wt.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mZT5eXy9Tapf85LV62hkfaVp2Of.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":308529,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ryB7c9cdwSdQlMIu9OsnDKmq2Wt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ryB7c9cdwSdQlMIu9OsnDKmq2Wt.jpg","language":"it","width":600,"height":900},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ryB7c9cdwSdQlMIu9OsnDKmq2Wt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ryB7c9cdwSdQlMIu9OsnDKmq2Wt.jpg","language":"it","width":600,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mVYUvtqWB5KWSkPiPxIfQKvMWEq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mVYUv